# Build and release gate

Before marking any **code** task complete:

1. Run:
   - `dotnet build src\SiNet.App.Wpf\SiNet.App.Wpf.csproj`
   - `dotnet test src\SiNet.App.Wpf.Tests\SiNet.App.Wpf.Tests.csproj`
2. Fix all compile errors — do not leave the repo in a broken build state.
3. In the final report, state: build pass/fail, test pass/fail, DB/schema changes (must be none unless explicitly requested).

If `dotnet build` fails on file locks, retry once; if COM/MSBuild environment issues appear, document the exact error.

Do not disable New System startup unless the user explicitly asks.
